From: mpc823 <11076149+mpc823@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ffmpeg: include codec version header before BSF checks

The stream and record headers select between the historical
AVBitStreamFilterContext and the modern AVBSFContext using
LIBAVCODEC_VERSION_INT.  That macro is not guaranteed to be provided by
libavformat.h alone, which makes the old branch selected with FFmpeg 6.
Include the authoritative codec version header explicitly.  The guarded
selection remains unchanged for older receiver toolchains.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 src/driver/streamts.h | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

--- a/src/driver/streamts.h
+++ b/src/driver/streamts.h
@@ -32,3 +32,7 @@
 extern "C" {
+#include <libavcodec/version.h>
+#if LIBAVCODEC_VERSION_INT >= AV_VERSION_INT(57,52,100)
+#include <libavcodec/bsf.h>
+#endif
 #include <libavformat/avformat.h>
 }
